  {
    "id": "2262ac0e044e38d182b1",
    "source": "The server applies subclass resistances, immunities, save advantages, AC, speed, initiative advantage, marks (Ancestral Protectors, Unwavering Mark), Assassinate, Among the Dead, Fungal Body, Protective Spirit, Celestial Resilience and the rest: never add them by hand and never pass advantage for them. GAME STATE tags such a subclass feature [server] when the server applies it, and [use_resource] when it is spent through that tool. The server applies Aura of Protection (on and off the map), Danger Sense, Evasion, Relentless Rage, Survivor, and the racial save advantages; never add them yourself. A feature that makes a character immune to a condition refuses it through set_condition, which says so: narrate them shrugging it off.",
